WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
Not bad. I'm very satisfied.

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,400
Thank you boss for the compliment

3
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:06,860
You, you have found the wrong person. I am not Wang Sheng.

4
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:08,300
Why haven't I noticed it before?

5
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:09,700
Wang Sheng is so humorous

6
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,020
My stomach hurts from laughing

7
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:12,100
He is a company executive

8
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,020
Hundreds of thousands of people a year

9
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,300
This is called being close to life

10
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:15,540
Stop hiding, Wang Sheng

11
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:17,140
Open the door and let's talk

12
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:18,500
This layer of anti-theft door is considered protection

13
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,100
Your last line of defense

14
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:21,420
Once broken

15
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:23,660
Doesn't that mean anyone can come in and bully me?

16
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:27,680
Don't pry, don't pry, I'll open it

17
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:29,480
Company executives are here

18
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:31,200
Just a few words of fright will make you scared.

19
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:39,230
What's wrong with me, brother?

20
00:00:39,230 --> 00:00:40,830
Now that the door is open

21
00:00:40,830 --> 00:00:43,230
Then let's go inside and have a good talk.
